    {
      "id": "SCENE",
      "title": "让██笑一笑",
      "choicePrompt": "",
      "background": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（……好，就让它们笑一笑吧。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/c96da969cdec9aca63d5.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "这个念头毫无来由地浮上心头。你甚至已经想好了该怎么做，随后才感到一丝困惑。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（……奇怪。我以前，也做过这样的事么？）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "眼前忽然闪过几个零碎的画面。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你蹲在那些小小的生物面前，伸出手逗弄着它们。那抹粉色就在身旁，随着笑声轻轻晃动。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "助手？",
          "text": "丰川同学，你在和██玩吗？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "近在耳边的声音将你从回忆中唤了回来。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你循声抬头，面前的女性正看着你，似乎在等你的回答。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/5fe0a2b5ea02e07f64d7.png",
              "x": 810.9,
              "y": 1488.7,
              "height": 1450,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（……这位是，入队仪式时站在那位紫发女性身旁的人。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（记得……似乎是她的助手。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "……请问，您认识我？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "女性微微一怔，随即露出有些无奈的神情。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/fb54f16f74a6bd4422ed.png",
              "x": 810.9,
              "y": 1488.7,
              "height": 1450,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "助手？",
          "text": "又在和茅森同学玩什么游戏吗？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/5fe0a2b5ea02e07f64d7.png",
              "x": 810.9,
              "y": 1488.7,
              "height": 1450,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "助手？",
          "text": "██同学，我是——",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "熟悉的刺痛骤然袭来。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/b04f3c2031329c67643b.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你下意识地按住额角，努力想听清她接下来的话，眼前的身影却已经模糊起来。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/5fe0a2b5ea02e07f64d7.png",
              "x": 810.9,
              "y": 1488.7,
              "height": 1450,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 0.7
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（……请等一下。我还没有——）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/5fe0a2b5ea02e07f64d7.png",
              "x": 810.9,
              "y": 1488.7,
              "height": 1450,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 0.3
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "再次睁眼，面前只剩下塔内冰冷的墙壁。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/94f82a588fa5f0bb389a.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（又是这样......）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "CHOICE",
          "text": "温柔＋8，从3张卡牌中选择1张获得。",
          "description": "温柔＋8，从3张卡牌中选择1张获得。",
          "nextPage": "SCENE_2",
          "rewards": {
            "sense": "Gentleness",
            "senseAmount": 8,
            "cardChoices": 3
          }
        }
      ],
      "characters": [],
      "metCharacters": [
        "nanami"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SCENE_3",
      "title": "教██一些杂技吧",
      "choicePrompt": "",
      "background": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（……好，就教它们一些杂技吧。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/c96da969cdec9aca63d5.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（不过，教些什么才好呢……）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（……有了。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "千早同学？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "蓝与金的双刀从空中的虫洞里落下，稳稳地落入你手中。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你将蓝色的长刀放在一旁，右手握住金色的短刀，左手虚托在身前，仿佛正托着什么东西。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "随后，你神情认真地削起了手中的空气。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "喂，丰川！你搞啥啊？！",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "为啥在██广场把炽天使召出来了，还在那儿削来削去的？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你停下动作，看向声音传来的方向。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/25d626445832af3abab3.png",
              "x": 800,
              "y": 1300.8,
              "height": 1286,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "我在教它们做刀削面。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "粉色的关西腔少女",
          "text": "……刀削面？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/c46ad72ed1200b5523a8.png",
              "x": 800,
              "y": 1300.8,
              "height": 1286,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "你没听说过么？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你略显意外，随即耐心地解释起来。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "就是一只手拿着面团，另一只手里拿刀，站在开水锅前，把面团削成细长的薄片下进锅里煮的面！",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "粉色的关西腔少女",
          "text": "谁问你面要怎么做了啊！",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/25d626445832af3abab3.png",
              "x": 800,
              "y": 1300.8,
              "height": 1286,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你的手停在了半空。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "粉色的关西腔少女",
          "text": "咱问的是，为什么要召唤炽天使！削个面需要用到那种东西吗？！",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "……欸？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "话音刚落，熟悉的刺痛骤然袭来。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/0e7852eda2e600c2faa4.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/25d626445832af3abab3.png",
              "x": 800,
              "y": 1300.8,
              "height": 1286,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 0.7
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "再次睁眼，面前只剩下塔内冰冷的墙壁。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/94f82a588fa5f0bb389a.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你低头看了看空空的左手。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（……说起来，我为什么会知道这种面的做法呢？）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（连手上的动作，都记得这样清楚……）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你试着回想了一会儿，最终轻轻叹了口气。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（下次若是有材料，就试着做一碗吧。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
